      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This broke my world last night.  I fixed it by moveing requestion serialization to an UdonBehaviour.SendCustomEventDelayedFrames and that fixed nearly everything.  Although, requesting serialization worked on start for so long, I don't know how many pre-fabs and things made for vrchat that this affects.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
