      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've run into a similar issue after the update. Not quite like this with Start but similar to what it was mentioned earlier from DrBlackRat.\n\nFor some reason, my late joiners would not get any data once the world launches and fully join, only after owners of scripts made a RequestSerialization on their end I would finally get the data to work with. This sadly ended up breaking the world entirely.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
