      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am encountering similar problems since the update, and continue to have them after updating to ``2024.4.1p4``, build``1538``\n\nFor example, in this world, a Late-Joiner who joins after starting a poker table may not get any synchronization data, in which case any operations that cause synchronization of the poker table are no longer possible.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_c23688f4-7bf1-4ace-a87c-cf0213e62ce6\n\nIt is still possible that other existing worlds that synchronize on Join will have similar problems with Late-Joiner.",
