  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-22T11:02:29.946Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Trying to request serialisation of values during the `Start` Event, when loading into the world, by invoking `RequestSerialization` results in no synchronisation.\n\nI noticed this when Late-Joiners were not receiving the synced variable values on the networked `UdonBehaviour` in question.\n\nIf I delay the execution of `RequestSerialization` by a few seconds, it works again.\n\nThis started happening with `2024.4.1p3` and was not a bug before this version.",
